customer: attractive_guy
problem: screensaver
brief:
	A jock who doesn't care about computers, but his colleague at work has a cool screensaver, and he wants it too. The fix is the Pipes. No Cambion.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hey. Quick one, I've got the gym at six.
+ Big workout?
	(happy) Legs. Always legs on a Tuesday.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(problem) Look, I don't care about computers. But a guy at work has these pipes on his screen.
	(happy) A good-looking guy like me needs a good-looking screensaver.
	+ What do they look like?
		(neutral) Pipes. Coloured ones. They grow all over the screen. Sick.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
